/-- Genuine original admission and an actual arbitrary-background subtree run
supply its exact content. Both role zero (term) and role one (argument list) are
covered by the original Job predicate. No desired child values, semantic Expected,
native calibration, fixed-point equation, altered evaluator, or fuel bound is a
premise. The conclusion uses the literal original role-dispatched observer. -/
def ActualFramedContent : Prop :=
  ∀ (R : Program 2) (H : Program 1) (M W : Program 2)
    (body : Positive (Fin 1)) (alpha : Type) (Delta : List (Formula alpha))
    (c B job count value : OTerm alpha),
  Nonempty (Derivation body Delta
    (OriginalHereditaryInternalAgenda.Job H M W c B job)) →
  Nonempty (Derivation body Delta
    (SixSol20261112.Runtime.FramedCompletionDefinitions.Framed R job count value)) →
  Nonempty (Derivation body Delta
    (graph1 (SixSol20261113.Context.ChildContentDefinitions.observationFromJob
      (OriginalHereditaryEvaluatorDefinitions.evaluator R)) value job))
end LogicLineages.OrdinalComparison.TerminationOrdering.ID1Completion.SourceComputabilityCompletion.SixSol20261113.Erasure.FramedContentTargets
